cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "aihydro-core: Zero-Dependency Substrate for Scientific Defensibility"
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-06-13"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AI-Hydro/aihydro-core"
abstract: >
  aihydro-core is the zero-dependency substrate of the AI-Hydro ecosystem.
  It provides content-addressable hashing (SHA-256), the Store Protocol,
  a detached-process jobs substrate, a feature addressing system, and the
  domain-free science Protocols (ClaimStore, Auditor, UncertaintyProvider)
  that make research defensibility portable across domains.
